config DRM_IMG_BRICK_DC_METADATA
	tristate "TrimUI Brick PowerVR display metadata"
	depends on DRM_IMG_ROGUE
	help
	  Provides display metadata required by the stock NULL_WSEGL
	  pbuffer library. Does not allocate scanout buffers.
